@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
hide empty description

[*] --> Placed : customer pays

state Placed : restaurant decides
state Accepted : partner being assigned
state Preparing : kitchen cooking
state ReadyForPickup : waiting for partner
state PickedUp : on the way
state Delivered
state Cancelled : stock restored,\npayment refunded,\npartner freed

Placed --> Accepted : restaurant accepts\n/ assign partner (or queue)
Placed --> Cancelled : restaurant rejects\nor customer cancels
Accepted --> Preparing : restaurant starts cooking
Accepted --> Cancelled : customer cancels
Preparing --> ReadyForPickup : food ready
ReadyForPickup --> PickedUp : assigned partner picks up
PickedUp --> Delivered : partner delivers\n/ partner free, takes next waiting order

Delivered --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]

note right of Preparing
  No cancel from here on:
  food is already being made
end note
@enduml
